# NVIDIA N1x additions, composed after arch-base.packages and
# arch-aarch64.packages (arch-pkg-defaults aarch64-n1x): what every N1x
# laptop runs, which src/python/installer/hardware/n1x.py also installs. Board-specific
# packages (the ASUS ProArt P14's amplifier firmware) stay with their model's
# hardware setup.
linux
linux-headers
# Release firmware (1.0 and later) drives the panel from the GPU.
nvidia-open-dkms
nvidia-utils
libva-nvidia-driver
# arch-n1x-probe uses lspci.
pciutils
